    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Finding: VTAT Zones Show Non-Linear, Non-Monotonic Pattern\n- **Instant (2-2.9 min)**: 0% cancellation \u2014 immediate pickup prevents cancellation\n- **Low (3-5 min)**: ~26% \u2014 below baseline\n- **Baseline (5.1-11.9 min)**: ~31% \u2014 matches overall rate\n- **Dip (12-15 min)**: ~9% \u2014 **sunk-cost effect** (riders who waited are committed)\n- **Timeout (15.1-20 min)**: 100% \u2014 **system auto-cancellation**"
      }
    },
