        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Finding: vtat_missing Is a Strong Binary Signal\nEvery row with missing avg_vtat is cancelled (phi \u2248 0.40). These represent early cancellations before vehicle assignment \u2014 100% precision but only ~22% of all cancellations.\n\n### Finding: Location Patterns Are Faint\nCramer's V \u2248 0.037 for both pickup and drop locations. Top locations show ~35-39% cancellation vs 32% baseline (~7pp swing)."
